flowchart TB
  Internet((Internet)) --> ALB[Application Load Balancer<br/>public subnets A/B]
  ALB -->|TCP 8000; SG reference| A[EC2 app A<br/>private subnet]
  ALB -->|TCP 8000; SG reference| B[EC2 app B<br/>private subnet]
  A & B -->|IAM role; no access keys| AWS[AWS managed services]
  API[AWS API activity] --> CT[CloudTrail] --> S3[(Encrypted private S3)]
  CT --> CW[CloudWatch Logs]
  GD[GuardDuty] --> Findings[Security findings]
  GitHub[GitHub Actions] -->|OIDC temporary credentials| Role[AWS IAM role]

